              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu ŵasalile ŵanduwo kuti, “Malemba gakuti, ‘Nyumba jangu tijiciŵa malo gakupopelelamo.’ Nambo jemanja mjitesile kuŵa mbanga jakuŵamo ŵaciswamba.”",
          "type": "text",
